From: =?UTF-8?q?Tiziano=20M=C3=BCller?= <tiziano.mueller@hpe.com>
Date: Sun, 10 Aug 2026 17:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] kmp_files: remove flavor suffix for EL kernels

On EL-based distributions, kernel versions do not include a flavor
suffix (no -default, -preempt, etc.). The modules_install target
places modules at /lib/modules/KVER/extra/, so the kmp_files listing
must match without appending -%1 (flavor).

Signed-off-by: Tiziano Mueller <tiziano.mueller@hpe.com>
---
 kmp_files | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/kmp_files b/kmp_files
index 1234567..abcdefg 100644
--- a/kmp_files
+++ b/kmp_files
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 %defattr (-,root,root)
-/lib/modules/%2-%1
+/usr/lib/modules/%2
 /usr/bin/rxe_init.sh
